          "correct": 1,
          "why": "19:29–20:01「My three-year-old daughter likes baking... set up so that every weekend, you know, like we have a baking project that is kind of reasonable for a three-year-old and an adult who knows nothing about baking and use Instacart or whatever to go get all the ingredients」。爬山許可證是幫大女兒申請的（20:32「my older daughter has kind of gotten into climbing mountains」），MMA 攝影機是用來分析他自己的訓練（21:03），在家自學則是 beta 測試者的用法（22:35），都不是幫三歲女兒安排的週末活動。"
